OL,3,AAsos app users tell BBC they are
OL,4,A'scared' after 'concerning' pop-up
OL,5,Amessage apparently from hackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Asos customer says they are "scared
OL,8,Fto go into" the online retailer's app
OL,9,Fafter being sent a pop-up message
OL,10,Fapparently from hackers - what we know
OL,11,Fso far
OL,13,FAnother customer, Jodie from Edinburgh,
OL,14,Fsays "it's concerning" and she
OL,15,Finitially thought the notification was
OL,16,F"an ad or fun promotion"
OL,18,F"Dear Asos DPO and IT, we have fully
OL,19,Fcompromised the Snowflake instance.
OL,20,FEngage with us, or we will leak it,"
OL,21,Fthe message - sent to shoppers in
OL,22,Fmultiple countries - reads
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
